  (text "Waveshare 7inch DSI LCD (C): DSI plus a separate 5 V / touch lead; all display wiring stays in the cassette."
    (at 20.32 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "d655fe5f-572c-5f3f-b6c4-cd9dc3822999"))
  (text "The NVMe Base Duo takes data and power on the PCIe FFC; its standoffs carry the Pi."
    (at 20.32 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "7c455616-2acf-54e3-8916-873a5b434bc3"))
  (text "VBAT_PI is the ML-2020 on J5, with rtc_bbat_vchg=3000000 in config.txt."
    (at 20.32 165.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left)) (uuid "b0e9bfe4-c79e-598f-bb0c-6adb67091ce5"))
  (text "USB_KEYBOARD is the K06 dongle in a Pi USB-A, or nothing at all over Bluetooth."
